    <string name="reinstall_body">This version is signed with a different key than the app on this phone, so Android cannot install it over this one. This happens once, when the signing key changes.

1. Open Molfar Vertep, Settings → Backup, and save a full backup (with a password, so your API keys are in it).
2. Download the new version below.
3. Uninstall this app, then install the downloaded one.
4. Restore the backup in Settings → Backup.

From then on, updates install over the app with your data kept.</string>
